# REVIEW 99511ff (fable_pc's mutant M51 and probe P59): a named Structure of fields only, executed in an
# `else:` of the root and of a method -- the scan that finds executions goes into `else:` bodies too, so its
# procedure exists; each execution runs its declaration again: n back to 3 after the root wrote 8, and again
# after the root wrote 8 and run executed it.  Entry 7.
Counter:
    size_t: n 3U
return
size_t: a 9U
Counter\n: 8U
if: a = 0U
    a: 1U
else:
    Counter
a: Counter\n
fn: run () size_t
    size_t: v 9U
    if: 1 = 0
        v: 0U
    else:
        Counter
    v: Counter\n
    return: v
Counter\n: 8U
size_t: b 9U
b: run()
int: ok 0
if: a = 3U && b = 3U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
